      "writtenOn": "2021-04-09T21:29:43Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "It works as a side effect of supporting both EC and Zephyr Kconfig options in the same macro.\n\nIn CrOS EC: IS_ENABLED(...) detects if something is defined to the empty token\nIn Zephyr: IS_ENABLED(...) detects if something is defined to the token \"1\"\n\nThe shim version replaces IS_ENABLED() with a version that permits both, given we have to mix code together here.\n\nSo -DHAS_TASK_* would not actually work in the CrOS EC world, but it would with Zephyr.",
      "parentUuid": "f100a95a_b4722b74",
